# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Your work is yours, and it is deliberately not in this repo.
#
# The premise of this kit is that you solve each problem yourself, so a clone
# arrives with no solutions, no notes, no hint ladders and no progress. Drop a
# line below if you would rather track your own — but think twice before you
# push someone a repo with the answers already in it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/solutions/
/progress.json
content/problems/*/notes.md
content/problems/*/hints.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Fetched from LeetCode — not ours to redistribute.
#
# `go run ./cmd/nc fetch` rebuilds all of these in a few minutes, and a re-run
# only fills in what is missing. The seven premium problems are the exception:
# LeetCode will not serve them, so their statements and signatures are written
# by hand and are tracked here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
content/problems/*/problem.md
content/problems/*/signature.txt

!content/problems/0252-meeting-rooms/problem.md
!content/problems/0252-meeting-rooms/signature.txt
!content/problems/0253-meeting-rooms-ii/problem.md
!content/problems/0253-meeting-rooms-ii/signature.txt
!content/problems/0261-graph-valid-tree/problem.md
!content/problems/0261-graph-valid-tree/signature.txt
!content/problems/0269-alien-dictionary/problem.md
!content/problems/0269-alien-dictionary/signature.txt
!content/problems/0271-encode-and-decode-strings/problem.md
!content/problems/0271-encode-and-decode-strings/signature.txt
!content/problems/0286-walls-and-gates/problem.md
!content/problems/0286-walls-and-gates/signature.txt
!content/problems/0323-number-of-connected-components-in-an-undirected-graph/problem.md
!content/problems/0323-number-of-connected-components-in-an-undirected-graph/signature.txt

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output, editors, OS cruft
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/nc
*.test
*.out

.idea/
.DS_Store
